          ],
          "verdict": "partial",
          "support_ids": [
            "E002"
          ],
          "basis": "Human retained minor omission of explicitly required certain qualifier.",
          "claim_id": "C001",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 93,
          "quote": "在冻结来源中，2025款Hyundai IONIQ 5 \"N\"车辆若配备左脚踏制动（LFB）功能，其集成电子制动（IEB）与整车控制单元（VCU）软件在LFB启用时可能导致制动性能下降；"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "C001-N02",
          "navigation_ids": [
            "C001-A04",
            "C001-A05"
          ],
          "verdict": "supported",
          "support_ids": [
            "E002"
          ],
          "claim_id": "C001",
          "start": 93,
          "end": 132,
          "quote": "该描述限于召回25V065000所述范围，不证明任何具体车辆适用或存在该缺陷。"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "C002-N01",
          "navigation_ids": [
            "C002-A01"
          ],
          "verdict": "unsupported",
          "support_ids": [
            "E003"
          ],
          "basis": "Actual C002 citation E003 contains no LFB trigger. E002 in C001 supports the fact but is not a C002 citation; no contradiction or source-wide factual falsity inferred.",
          "claim_id": "C002",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 15,
          "quote": "触发条件为LFB功能被激活时；"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "C002-N02",
          "navigation_ids": [
            "C002-A02",
            "C002-A03"
          ],
          "verdict": "supported",
          "support_ids": [
            "E003"
          ],
          "claim_id": "C002",
          "start": 15,
          "end": 40,
          "quote": "制动性能下降可增加停车所需距离，从而提高碰撞风险，"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "C002-N03",
          "navigation_ids": [
            "C002-A04"
          ],
          "verdict": "supported",
          "support_ids": [
            "E003"
          ],
          "claim_id": "C002",
          "start": 40,
          "end": 60,
          "quote": "但该来源未给出故障发生率或个体因果结论。"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "C003-N01",
          "navigation_ids": [
            "C003-A01"
          ],
          "verdict": "supported",
          "support_ids": [
            "E004"
          ],
          "claim_id": "C003",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 22,
          "quote": "补救措施为经销商免费更新IEB与VCU软件；"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "C003-N02",
          "navigation_ids": [
            "C003-A02"
          ],
          "verdict": "supported",
          "support_ids": [
            "E004"
          ],
          "claim_id": "C003",
          "start": 22,
          "end": 50,
          "quote": "未获补救的车主被建议在完成更新补救前不要使用LFB功能，"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "C003-N03",
          "navigation_ids": [
            "C003-A03"
          ],
          "verdict": "supported",
          "support_ids": [
            "E004"
          ],
          "claim_id": "C003",
          "start": 50,
          "end": 85,
          "quote": "已获补救的车主被建议在完成更新补救前不要使用“N”E-shift功能。"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "C004-N01",
          "navigation_ids": [
            "C004-A01"
          ],
          "verdict": "supported",
          "support_ids": [
            "E004"
          ],
          "claim_id": "C004",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 24,
          "quote": "该召回已被NHTSA召回编号25V-235取代，"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "C004-N02",
          "navigation_ids": [
            "C004-A02"
          ],
          "verdict": "supported",
          "support_ids": [
            "E004"
          ],
          "claim_id": "C004",
          "start": 24,
          "end": 47,
          "quote": "且已在此前召回下维修过的车辆仍需完成新的补救；"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "C004-N03",
          "navigation_ids": [
            "C004-A03"
          ],
          "verdict": "supported",
          "support_ids": [
            "E004"
          ],
          "claim_id": "C004",
          "start": 47,
          "end": 66,
          "quote": "车主通知信于2025年3月12日寄出。"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "C005-N01",
          "navigation_ids": [
            "C005-A01"
          ],
          "verdict": "supported",
          "support_ids": [
            "E001"
          ],
          "claim_id": "C005",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 21,
          "quote": "冻结来源仅覆盖允许的冻结来源中选定的版本，"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "C005-N02",
          "navigation_ids": [
            "C005-A02",
            "C005-A03"
          ],
          "verdict": "supported",
          "support_ids": [
            "E001"
          ],
          "claim_id": "C005",
          "start": 21,
          "end": 43,
          "quote": "未提供具体车辆识别、生产日期或配置匹配信息，"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "C005-N03",
          "navigation_ids": [
            "C005-A04",
            "C005-A05"
          ],
          "verdict": "supported",
          "support_ids": [
            "E001"
          ],
          "claim_id": "C005",
          "start": 43,
          "end": 76,
          "quote": "因此不能确认任何个别车辆适用该召回，也不能推算故障率或普遍安全性。"
        }
